{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20265RMzdl30vS1793119490.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中國網球巡迴賽香港公開賽下月在維園舉行。</p><p></p><p>征戰完名古屋亞運，U18香港排名第一的黎清嵐連續兩屆參戰，她認為在這種大型賽事比賽，有助磨練心態，亦希望憑亞運的經驗，令她在中巡賽打出更成熟表現。</p><p></p><p>港將王康怡、黃俊鏗亦會出戰，還有全運男雙金牌孫淺，上屆男單亞軍、鄭欽文的陪練肖霖昂等。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_JS.TENNIS.PC-1700_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026AIR3zhvve01793119900.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>這項CTA1000賽事連續四年在香港舉行，超過150位全國球手參戰，總獎金80萬人民幣，賽事11月22日展開。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T18:01:32.676202+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":194,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T16:43:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T18:18:11.896649+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T17:59:07.020316+00:00","content_hash":"d3662dc60d269babbca8aeeddca1788485865a26e9476b4199a585f14dbf7264","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T18:01:32.676202+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}